<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Orckit said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orckit said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co initiated coverage of Orckit Communications Ltd  with a buy rating, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 12-1/8.</p>
</text>
